keywords:
  - retained demand
  - backend retained demand
  - digital assets
  - institutional finance
  - liquidity density
  - evidence-gated sizing
  - structural audit
  - XRP
abstract: >-
  This research archive develops a retained-demand audit framework for
  institutionally connected digital assets. The series distinguishes visible
  usage from retained demand, infrastructure expansion from asset necessity,
  and sizing from price prediction. XRP is used as a stress-test case, not as
  an investment thesis or price forecast.
